{% comment %}
  Brand typeface: TT Commons Pro, self-hosted from theme assets.

  Two files are licensed and shipped:
    500 Medium  body copy and headings
    700 Bold    emphasis

  The Figma also uses DemiBold (600) for card titles and the wordmark, and
  Regular (400) in a few places. Those files are not supplied, so the browser
  resolves 600 to the Bold file and 400 to the Medium file. To add either
  weight later, drop the woff2 into assets/ and add a matching @font-face
  block here.

  Must be rendered inside a {% style %} or <style> block.
{% endcomment %}
@font-face {
  font-family: 'TT Commons Pro';
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 500;
  font-display: swap;
  src: url('{{ 'tt-commons-pro-medium.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
}
@font-face {
  font-family: 'TT Commons Pro';
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-display: swap;
  src: url('{{ 'tt-commons-pro-bold.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
}
